---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /expertise/
title: "Commercial, Healthcare & Data Centre Cooling | GMA Air Conditioning"
description: "GMA Air Conditioning delivers specialist HVAC solutions for commercial offices, healthcare facilities, data centres, retail, residential and BESS sites across Scotland."
crumb: Expertise
---
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Sectors</span>
    <h1>Areas of Expertise</h1>
    <p>Our engineers have extensive experience across a wide range of industries, delivering tailored climate control solutions for every environment.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container grid grid--3">
    {%- for s in sectors.items %}
    <article class="card" id="{{ s.title | slugify2 }}">
      <div class="card__icon">{% icon s.icon %}</div>
      <h3>{{ s.title }}</h3>
      <p>{{ s.text }}</p>
      <ul>{% for p in s.points %}<li>{% icon "check" %} {{ p }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
    </article>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="container" style="text-align:center;max-width:760px">
    <h2>Have a Project in Mind?</h2>
    <p class="lead">Whatever your sector, our experienced team can deliver the right climate control solution. Get in touch for a free consultation.</p>
    <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact/">Contact us {% icon "arrow" %}</a>
  </div>
</section>
